{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261029/photo/bkn-20261029094650760-1029_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261029112407\"/><p>佐敦發生火警。今晨(29日)9時29分，彌敦道192-194號地下一間餐廳，油煙槽冒出大量濃煙，並攻出街外，驚動多人報案。消防員接報到場開喉撲救，同時搜救隊到場協助救援，迅速將火勢救熄。</p><p>餐廳職員及食客自行疏散，事件中無人傷。據網上圖片所見，餐廳面向柯士甸道的油煙槽噴出灰黃色濃煙，連彌敦道亦被濃煙籠罩，途人均掩着口鼻走避。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T03:42:02.612422+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":170,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T01:46:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T11:18:14.435740+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T03:38:40.727339+00:00","content_hash":"50700d9ec4bcde30f4ac5fc2e85a4613615c177f8a2abbeda83fef2b0886171e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T03:42:02.612422+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}